# The captures are stored byte-exact: MANIFEST.json carries the sha256 of each file as captured on 2026-10-11 (CRLF
# line endings included), and tests/test_server.py checks the files against those hashes on every platform.
*.json -text
# Builder B: the record-only golden runs under golden/ (every file hashes to the run's own manifest.sha256) and the
# desktop simlab evidence ledger are stored byte-exact too; golden/MANIFEST.json carries their provenance.
golden/** -text
# the MLflow browser's one artifact capture (2026-10-11), byte-exact like the JSON captures
*.cvg -text
